<title>JAPAN: TSE, China to agree on listing Chinese companies.</title>
<headline>TSE, China to agree on listing Chinese companies.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Friday that it would sign a cooperation agreement with the Chinese Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) in Tokyo on March 18.</p>
<p>The agreement will enable Chinese companies to list their shares on the Tokyo exchange, an exchange official said.</p>
